# Container map keys are rejected

Verifies that an array cannot be used as a map key. Map keys must be scalar
values with a stable complete identity.

>>> source
let values = {
    [1]: 2
}

print(values)

<<< stdout

<<< stderr
eck: map key must be a hashable scalar value at Span { start: 19, end: 22 }

<<< exit
1
